{"t":"Temple of Xayepocax","s":"temple-of-xayepocax-4fbec","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Temple_of_Xayepocax_ad574a.png","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p>The <b>Temple of Xayepocax</b> is a room deep down in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a>. It houses a quest and many, many different <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a>. This is a great place to try and kill your first <a href=\"#/wiki/Warlock\">Warlock</a>. A good strategy would be to lead him through the entrance's narrow corridor and then trap him in a corner.\n</p><p>After the lvl 70 <a href=\"#/wiki/Gate%20of%20Expertise\">Gate of Expertise</a> in the south of the room, you will find a teleporter which will take you to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Forge\">Demon Forge</a> (you will need lvl 100 to be able to enter it though).\n</p><p>Home to the <a href=\"#/quest/vampire-shield-quest\">Vampire Shield Quest</a>.\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Temple of Xayepocax\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"156\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Temple_of_Xayepocax_ad574a.png\" width=\"114\"/></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<p>In total, this room contains 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Demon%20Skeleton\">Demon Skeletons</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Monk%20%28Creature%29\">Monks</a>, 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero\">Heroes</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Priestess\">Priestesses</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Witch\">Witches</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Magician\">Dark Magicians</a>, 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Apprentice\">Dark Apprentices</a>, an <a href=\"#/wiki/Orc%20Shaman\">Orc Shaman</a>, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Stalker\">Stalker</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Warlock\">Warlock</a>. <b>Note:</b> they respawn fairly quickly, so be careful.<br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stalker\"><img alt=\"Stalker\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stalker_387d29.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Stalker\">Stalker</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">90</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">120</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">100 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">70 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>, <span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">30 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Life%20Drain\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Life_Drain_Icon_bda9d3.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span>)</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>0-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blank%20Rune\">Blank Rune</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Shield\">Brass Shield</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>0-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Throwing%20Knife\">Throwing Knife</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Legs\">Brass Legs</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Miraculum (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a h