mon)</li>\n<li>0-8× <a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Star%20Herb\">Star Herb</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Witch Broom (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Wolf%20Tooth%20Chain\">Wolf Tooth Chain</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Leather%20Boots\">Leather Boots</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Cape (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Garlic%20Necklace\">Garlic Necklace</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sickle\">Sickle</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Coat (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Bag of Apple Slices (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Necrotic%20Rod\">Necrotic Rod</a> (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Dagger\">Silver Dagger</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Witch Hat (very rare)</li>\n<li>Stuffed Toad (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\"><img alt=\"Hunter\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hunter_bbba27.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunter</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">150</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">120 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-22× <a href=\"#/wiki/Arrow\">Arrow</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Hunter's Quiver (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Orange</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Roll\">Roll</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Ar